          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú mibeeri tám nee gwaleél oo waawuti'iimár Asariya oo Yudawo, Shalumu garmoó Yabeshi waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún baraá Israeliro. Inós baraá waawuti'iimaro slahhaangw ngwa /aáy a wak, baraá gixsár Samariaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.13",
