          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahemu garmoó Gadi ina Tirsár wa tláy ay Samaria, nee baraá Samariaro Shalumu garmoó Yabeshi guri gaás. Inós iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' sleémeero awa Shalumu aa tleéhh nee geewaqatuuwós kudá' aa tleéhh sleémeero kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú qom'aá waawituú Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Menahemu iwa baraá loohirí dirii'i iwa amór Tirsár dahhi, gixsár Tapua nee yaamuloousér ayaadae gana hhaamiís, nee múk iisaapoó yaamudae, as niwa bartós ayi'iiká. Tam /ameenár tsiihawe sleeme gana gur'e feehhamiís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
