        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú mibeeri tám nee gwaleél oo waawuti'iimár Asariya oo Yudawo, Menahemu garmoó Gadi waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún baraá yaamaá Israeliro. Inós baraá waawuti'iimaro kureeri ngaa /aáy a mibaangw baraá gixsár Samariaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
