          "text": "Kurkú mibeeri kooán oo waawuti'iimár Asariya oo Yudawo, Pekahia garmoó Menahemu waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún baraá yaamaá Israeliro. Inós baraá waawuti'iimaro kureeri ngaa /aáy a tsár baraá Samariaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
