          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peka garmoó Remalia kuduú geeraharusmoó slaqwaruusér Pekahia, inós nee múk mibeeri kooán oo Gileadi tana aldinku'uús Pekahia nguwa geewaqaatiya', nguri gaasiyé' dinkwa nee Argobu nee Arie baraá guruú koo/ír gawit ar doó waawutmo, tidár baraá Samaria, Peka iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa aleeró.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.25",
