        {
          "text": "Qoomár waawuti'iimár Peka oo Israeliro, waawutmo Tiglat-pileseri oo Ashuru gixsadaá Iyoni, nee Abel-bet-ma'aka, nee Yanoa, nee Kadeshi nee Hasori dinkwa nee yaamaá Gileadiro, nee Galilayaro nee yaamu sleémeero awa Naftaliwo gina hayóh. Múk yaamuudá' guna haasaáng wá ar tláy ay Ashuru.",
