              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yotam iri gwaá', kway foól baraá /antaá waawitá, kudaá baraá gixsár Daudi. Garmaawós Ahasi iri waawuti'ín kitaángós wa alé.",
          "type": "text",
